									<ul style="font-family:Arial;padding:0;list-style:disc outside none;font-size:12px;margin:0;text-align:left;">
																					<li><b>UK driving licence holders:</b><br>When renting in the UK, Afghanistan, Angola, Austria, Bahrain, Balearics, Botswana, Canaries, Croatia, Democratic Republic of Congo, Ireland, Namibia, Oman, Portugal, Slovenia, South Africa, Sweden and Tunisia, all drivers with a UK licence will need to provide evidence of any driving endorsements.<br>Please see <a href="https://www.hertz.co.uk/p/vehicle-guide/picking-up-your-vehicle-hire" target="_blank">Terms and Conditions</a> for more information.</li>
